Use of Super Intelligence (SI)
The code and the data processing scripts in this repository were generated with
Claude (Anthropic), an AI assistant, under David Castro's direction during the
NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026 (November 14 to 15, 2026). All of the software
is new and was written during the hackathon. The text of the Space Apps project
page (research/SUBMISSION.md) was written by Gemini 4 Carbon (Google) from a
fact sheet and corrected after a check against it. The text of the
demo was written by Gemini 4 Argon (Google) from a brief of verified facts
and corrected by hand. The two voices in the demo (app/audio/vo) are synthetic:
they were generated from that text with ElevenLabs text to speech (library voices
"Jon - Calm Presence" and "Alex - Professional"). No SI generated images or video
are included. All imagery is NASA data rendered by the app.

