NASA material
- Z-2 Spacesuit model (app/models/z2_suit.glb), reduced in size for the web from
  the NASA 3D Resources model.
  https://github.com/nasa/NASA-3D-Resources/tree/master/3D%20Models/Z2%20Spacesuit
- Space Exploration Vehicle model (app/models/rover.glb), reduced in size for the web
  from the NASA 3D Resources model.
  https://github.com/nasa/NASA-3D-Resources/tree/master/3D%20Models/Space%20Exploration%20Vehicle
- Terrain, imagery, mineral, thermal, weather, radiation and space weather data and
  the Curiosity photos come from NASA, JPL-Caltech, MSSS, the University of Arizona,
  JHUAPL, ASU and USGS Astrogeology. The full list with links is in the app under
  "NASA data used" and in research/SUBMISSION.md.

